# The worker's /imports bind-mount root (docker-compose.dev.yaml). The
# directory itself is tracked so a fresh checkout owns it: Docker creates a
# missing bind-mount source as root, and the host user then cannot write the
# CSV that tests/e2e/test_connector_sync_flow.py drops in there. Its contents
# stay ignored.
!sample_data/connector_imports/
sample_data/connector_imports/*
!sample_data/connector_imports/.gitkeep

